<title>EL SALVADOR: EL SALVADOR COFFEE EXPORT UPDATE TO AUG 8-CONSEJO.</title>
<headline>EL SALVADOR COFFEE EXPORT UPDATE TO AUG 8-CONSEJO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN SALVADOR 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Salvadoran Coffee</p>
<p>Council updated coffee exports to Aug 8 for the 1996-1997 cycle.</p>
<p>Volumes in 100-lb (46-kg) bags, known as quintals.</p>
<p>    By Month		Quintals	 Percentage</p>
<p>    October			0		0.00</p>
<p>    November		58,125		2.06</p>
<p>    December		61,988		2.20</p>
<p>    January		490,088	     17.38</p>
<p>    February	     376,800	     13.36</p>
<p>    March		  421,913	     14.96</p>
<p>    April		  639,888	     22.69</p>
<p>    May		    364,020	     12.91</p>
<p>    June		   214,104		7.59</p>
<p>    July		   189,594		6.72</p>
<p>    August		  *3,000		0.11</p>
<p>    September		 --		   --</p>
<p>    Total		2,819,519	    100.00</p>
<p>* Update to August 8</p>
